Package: fss-adsb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, libfss (>= 1.0.2), libfss-transport (>= 1.0.2), libfss-transport-ssl (>= 1.0.2), libfss-client-ssl (>= 1.0.2)
Description: ADS-B integration for FSS
 Consumes the SBS-1 BaseStation output of a dump1090 receiver (port 30003)
 and reports the aircraft it hears as position reports to a Flight Safety
 System server over TLS, so nearby ADS-B traffic is visible to all FSS
 clients. Run one instance per FSS server; a templated systemd unit
 (fss-adsb@.service) is included.
